---
title: 人狼の襲撃が attackHistory に集約 target として記録される
setup: { werewolf: 1, villager: 3 }
rules:
  first-victim: none
---
# Alice (狼) が 1夜 に Bob を秘匿襲撃 → engine が集約決定し、
# Alice の attackHistory[1] に Bob (集約 target) を記録する。
# Day 1 投票で Dave 処刑、 Night 1 で Bob 襲撃 → 残り Alice + Carol で狼勝終局
# (終局は検証対象外)。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave
!Alice=人狼
!Bob=村人
!Carol=村人
!Dave=村人
!Alice 1夜 襲撃 Bob

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Alice→Dave
Bob→Dave
Carol→Dave
Dave→Alice

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Dave 3 / Alice 1 → execution=Dave
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 1 ==
# night_kill: Bob
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: werewolf_won
# survivors: Alice, Carol
# == end ==

# @expect-attack actor:Alice night:1 target:Bob
